7eWUrhSU01XtvttUkfVNT4UfXVHnzQjt5zb74ha84kRn9VU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFTPZMr6dV7noO9FNfzx9CEcGSNsziPnBA6NqrBIiv--g&oe=6A943138"}, "display_name": "Uchi, Kuru?", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\"Uchi, Kuru?\" (Wanna Come Over?) brings VRoid Hub characters into your real room in mixed reality.\n\nThrough passthrough your everyday room stays visible \u2014 and a character walks in, sits on your furniture, and chats with you. Let her wander, offer her a stool, or just relax side by side. Sign in to VRoid Hub and summon your own models or any model you've hearted (subject to each model's usage conditions).\n\n- 3 bundled characters: meet them right after install\n- VRoid Hub integration: summon your own or available hearted models\n- Watch YouTube together: float a TV in your room and watch side by side\n- Close enough to touch: pat her head, hold hands, offer her a seat\n\nAdd-ons (in-app purchases):\n- Remote Desktop: float your Mac's screen in the room and work while she keeps you company (free Mac server app)\n- Mahjong: full four-player riichi mahjong with calls, kan, riichi and ura dora\n- Game Set: Reversi, Old Maid and chess, with the characters as your opponents\n- Full Pack: everything above\n\nThe app supports Japanese and English. Character dialogue follows your language setting.\n\nCredits: Character animation: VRoid Project, pixiv Inc. / Animations: Adobe Mixamo", "short_description": "Your VRoid characters, living in your room. Through passthrough they walk your actual room, sit on a stool, and chat with you. Pat their heads, hold hands, watch YouTube and play board games together. Summon your own VRoid Hub models or hearted ones."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sticker.github.io/uchikuru/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Nice Sticker", "support_website_url": "https://sticker.github.io/uchikuru/#contact", "website_url": "https://